Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry? Want some of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:07.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a cutie! Do you want a snack?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.79,0:00:09.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't feed it junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe I have leftovers from lunch...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.71,0:00:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, well. Back again, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.29,0:00:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here, doggie! For you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:19.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.42,0:00:22.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh wow. This doggie has a big fat belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.42,0:00:30.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,64.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.33,0:01:28.33,Q2,,0,0,0,,{\pos(153.6,604.8)}{\an7}The Baron's Dog and the Floating Pig
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.79,0:01:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure enough!\NJogging is the best exercise for an elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.50,0:01:31.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Can't say the same for those losers...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.29,0:01:34.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Jeepers! I'm gonna shrivel up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.46,0:01:36.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't take any more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.08,0:01:38.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm wilting...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.04,0:01:39.21,Q3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(128,108)}{\an7}Twitch Twitch\N{\pos(1011.2,410.4)}{\an7}BAAAARF
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.04,0:01:43.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I invited them to join me,\Nbut they all went home early!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.29,0:01:46.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, too much exertion can lead to injury.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.71,0:01:50.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,By the way, do you come to\Nthis park often, Elfuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.21,0:01:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.88,0:01:54.92,Q4,,0,0,0,,{\pos(486.4,208.8)}{\an7}Alternate Dimension\N{\pos(537.6,410.4)}{\an7}Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.13,0:01:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is where I crossed over into your world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.71,0:01:54.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.33,0:01:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, this is the gate to your world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.75,0:01:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yep. It's how I come and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:03.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Does that mean\NI could visit your world, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.33,0:02:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only if you have mana.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:05.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.17,0:02:08.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Alright. Let's get back to running!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.63,0:02:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure. I'm right behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.04,0:02:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whew, I'm beat. Time for a post-run snack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:17.25,Q5,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.2,208.8)}{\an7}SHAZAM!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.46,0:02:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where the heck were you keeping that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.25,0:02:22.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm betting it wants your fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:27.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,But jeez! This doggie sure is big!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.04,0:02:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seems a little fat if you ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,When it comes to animals:\Nthe rounder, the cuter!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.29,0:02:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Who's a good doggie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.79,0:02:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aren't you just the cutest fluffball!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.96,0:02:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always wanted to have a pet dog\Nwhen I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.42,0:02:42.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.83,0:02:44.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Time for more pets!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.54,0:02:48.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not the kinda guy who should keep a pet...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:50.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,There, there! Good doggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.67,0:02:52.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.17,0:02:56.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, Elfuda!\NThis dog turned into a person!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.25,0:03:00.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's a lycanthrope.\NOtherwise known as a werewolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.71,0:03:03.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're prideful creatures that stand at\Nthe top of the food chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.75,0:03:06.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,But most of them have moody personalities\Nthat are annoying to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.63,0:03:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.67,0:03:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not taking that from an elf\Nwho reeks of grease!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.79,0:03:12.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I do NOT reek!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.54,0:03:14.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elves have a floral aroma!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.25,0:03:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't take it personally.\NDogs just have a sharp nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.83,0:03:18.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not a dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.50,0:03:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just get lost!\NI'm trying to exercise here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.04,0:03:23.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Exercise?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I recognize the roundness of those curves...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:29.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're on a diet, aren'tcha? Fatty fido!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.17,0:03:31.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a wolf!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.50,0:03:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Humans bring me lots of yummy treats.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:38.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to let any go to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.75,0:03:41.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But eating all of them made me FAT!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.17,0:03:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fucking humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.21,0:03:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a dirty mouth...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.79,0:03:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I keep running my ass off,\Nbut haven't shed any pounds!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.63,0:03:49.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,And my body is so heavy\Nthat it drags me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.96,0:03:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Then why not do some stretches\Nto help keep you moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.58,0:03:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stretches?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:04:00.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even just stretching for 5 minutes will have\Na significant impact if you do it daily.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.08,0:04:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are a lot of muscles clustered\Nnear your hip joints in particular,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.71,0:04:05.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,so loosen them up and get your\Nlymphatic system moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.54,0:04:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man! Stretches really work!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.96,0:04:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,My body feels nice and warm now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're pretty amazing for a mere human.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.54,0:04:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll give you permission to join my pack!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.21,0:04:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pack?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm the boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.58,0:04:21.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,She really has a thing for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.92,0:04:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lycanthropes typically operate in packs\Nonly with their own kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's rare for them to include an outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe you should learn to "shake."\NThen she'll like you even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Shake?" That's only for dogs...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.38,0:04:40.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ah! D-don't get the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.46,0:04:41.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:43.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:47.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I dunno why, but I can't control myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.63,0:04:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know, these guys can't disobey orders\Nfrom those who are higher up in the pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.33,0:04:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm betting she subconsciously
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.29,0:04:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,regarded you as superior while you\Nwere instructing us on stretches.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.58,0:05:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now she'll do whatever you want.\NEven "beg" if you say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.33,0:05:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Beg"? Get serious...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.00,0:05:11.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Begging?! Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.79,0:05:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.96,0:05:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh no! I can't stop! Please no!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beg!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,She reverted to her original form.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.25,0:05:25.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,The overwhelming shame made it\Nimpossible to stay as a human, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.46,0:05:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wah! I only wanted to lose some weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.50,0:05:35.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,What kind of pathetic pooch\Ncries over a little begging?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.13,0:05:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.58,0:05:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come on, Elfuda. Don't be so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:42.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nobody gets away with making fun of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.54,0:05:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You've got guts to fight with an elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,All right. Let me teach you some manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.92,0:05:51.79,Q6,,0,0,0,,{\pos(166.4,72)}{\an7}Sniffle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.79,0:05:54.79,Q7,,0,0,0,,{\pos(921.6,460.8)}{\an7}Plus-Sized Elf
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.38,0:05:53.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus-Sized Elf!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's move on from jogging.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.33,0:06:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's time to try the exercise\Nthat's most helpful for dieting.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.83,0:06:03.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,One, two, three, four!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Five, six, seven, eight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:08.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Chlorine ain't good fer me...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.67,0:06:12.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oopsies. I sucked up too much water...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.67,0:06:12.13,Q8,,0,0,0,,{\pos(870.4,316.8)}{\an7}Tremble
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.46,0:06:15.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez. Guess I gotta haul\Nyou guys to the rest area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.75,0:06:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hup! Heave-ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.33,0:06:20.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey! Be more gentle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.71,0:06:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm a wolf, but I can swim like a fish!\NJust watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.63,0:06:25.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.25,0:06:28.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,So slow...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.13,0:06:31.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, human. We're done warming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.29,0:06:34.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, why'd you recommend we try swimming?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.63,0:06:36.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He just wanted to see us\Nwearing swimsuits, duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:38.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.29,0:06:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Swimming is the perfect exercise\Nwhen you're on a diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.21,0:06:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,It takes a lot of energy to move\Nwhen you're underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:50.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,And the water resistance helps to evenly\Nstimulate all the muscles in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.04,0:06:53.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus, the buoyancy reduces\Nthe strain put on your joints,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.13,0:06:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,which means less injuries!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.67,0:06:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Makes sense! I'll give it a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.17,0:07:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,You should have told me\Nthat you don't know how to swim!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.92,0:07:06.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, water walking has\Njust as many benefits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.13,0:07:08.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make sure to move your whole body!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.42,0:07:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And after 30 minutes or so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.96,0:07:12.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.96,0:07:17.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey! Boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.54,0:07:20.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.00,0:07:22.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You came for a swim, too, boss?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.00,0:07:25.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pardon me, but I think you're confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:27.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not this "Boss" person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:30.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,My name is Oku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.63,0:07:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oops. I guess she does look\Na bit larger than the boss is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.04,0:07:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shucks! You look just like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.29,0:07:40.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.08,0:07:45.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your friends seem to be having\Na lot of fun in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm actually a recent\Ntransplant in this worl-
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.79,0:07:50.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.79,0:07:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't made any friends yet,\Nso I'm a little jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.42,0:07:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:57.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,We finished exercising for 30 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.58,0:07:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:01.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm really feeling it in my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.17,0:08:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,And with proper nutrition,\Nyou can double the effect!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:06.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,All it takes is some vegetables\Nand high-quality protein...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Elves only eat vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.38,0:08:10.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that's just a preference, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:15.13,Q9,,0,0,0,,{\pos(908.8,468)}{\an7}Thigh and tenderloin\N{\pos(934.4,504)}{\an7}meat is the best!!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.67,0:08:12.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I recommend you try meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.00,0:08:15.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Specifically pork, which is rich\Nin vitamins and carnitine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:18.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!\NEating pigs is beyond cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.08,0:08:21.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa. Those ears...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:24.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sneaky! I didn't realize because of\Nhow slimmed down she is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.42,0:08:26.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,but this girl is an Orc!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.17,0:08:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,"Orc"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:31.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,A race of creatures that live in\Nthe forest just like us elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.83,0:08:35.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Their bodies tend to be very stout.\NTo put it simply...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.54,0:08:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're piglike humanoids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.42,0:08:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, we are not!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.17,0:08:42.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, I guess we do share\Na slight bond with pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.92,0:08:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Slight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.88,0:08:47.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,A legend passed down among Orcs, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.46,0:08:52.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes. It speaks of a technique in this world\Nthat even Orcs can use to lose weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:55.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So I came here and discovered\Nthe ancient art of the "diet"!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.17,0:09:00.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,It taught me that pool exercise was best\Nfor people with hefty bodies like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.42,0:09:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,And after giving it a try,\NI found it was very effective!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.42,0:09:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Once I learn all the diet techniques\Nand return home,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,then Orcs will never get made fun of\Nfor being "fatheads" or "slowpokes"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.13,0:09:13.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You could learn a thing or two from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, if an Orc can lose this much weight,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:19.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,then you weren't kidding about\Nhow effective swimming is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.58,0:09:23.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've never seen an Orc\Nthis in shape before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.58,0:09:25.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,R-really?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.54,0:09:27.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not bad for an inferior Orc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.21,0:09:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, shucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.21,0:09:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're making fun of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.13,0:09:34.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Swimming really is the better exercise, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.04,0:09:35.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think I'll give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.17,0:09:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why not save it for another day?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.46,0:09:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,My legs feel like jelly,\Nso there's no way I can swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.13,0:09:45.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Less jelly and more flab, in your case!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.50,0:09:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:49.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Death to dark elves!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.50,0:09:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You first, fatty!\NYou're more of a pig than the Orcs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:55.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stop! It's dangerous to\Nroughhouse by the pool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.58,0:10:00.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.92,0:10:03.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm s-s-s-s-s-sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm such a good swimmer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.79,0:10:10.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing like a popsicle after a good swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.96,0:10:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:13.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really warms ya up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.63,0:10:15.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, that's backwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:18.67,Q10,,0,0,0,,{\pos(473.6,86.4)}{\an7}Massage Relaxation
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:18.67,Q11,,0,0,0,,{\pos(460.8,626.4)}{\an7}Beauty - Health - Diet
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:23.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Have you been swimming every day?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.42,0:10:27.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah... only once in a while\Nis enough for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.33,0:10:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aw, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.71,0:10:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, welcome in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.08,0:10:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mister Human!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.96,0:10:35.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oku?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What on Earth happened to you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.92,0:10:41.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,They shut down the pool\Nat the gym for renovations!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.17,0:10:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,And it caused my weight to bounce back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.50,0:10:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What am I gonna do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.71,0:10:49.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't fret. It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.96,0:10:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's turn that frown upside down\Nby eating some French fries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:55.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oink! But I'm trying to lose weight!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:59.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please! Teach me other ways\Nthat I can shed some pounds!
